1</ext-link></comment><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">3915301</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="R5"><label>5</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group><name><surname>Day</surname><given-names>CP</given-names></name><name><surname>James</surname><given-names>OF</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Steatohepatitis: a tale of two "hits"?</article-title><source>Gastroenterology</source><year>1998</year><volume>114(4)</volume><fpage>842</fpage><lpage>845</lpage><comment>DOI: 10.1016/S0016-5085(98)70599-2</comment><comment>Available from: <ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://dx.doi.org/10.1016/S0016-5085(98)70599-2">http://dx.doi.org/10.1016/S0016-5085(98)70599-2</ext-link></comment><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9547102</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="R6"><label>6</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group><name><surname>Day</surname><given-names>CP</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Pathogenesis of steatohepatitis</article-title><source>Best Pract Res Clin Gastroenterol</source><year>2002</year><volume>16(5)</volume><fpage>663</fpage><lpage>678</lpage><comment>DOI: 10.1053/bega.2002.0333</comment><comment>Available from: <ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://dx.doi.org/10.1053/bega.2002.0333">http://dx.doi.org/10.1053/bega.2002.0333</ext-link></comment><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12406438</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="R7"><label>7</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group><name><surname>Grattagliano</surname><given-names>I</given-names></name><name><surname>Vendemiale</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Caraceni</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Domenicali</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Nardo</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Cavallari</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Trevisani</surname><given-names>F</given-names></n