rname>Friedewald</surname><given-names>WT</given-names></name><name><surname>Levy</surname><given-names>RI</given-names></name><name><surname>Fredrickson</surname><given-names>DS</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Estimation of the concentration of low-density lipoprotein cholesterol in plasma, without use of the preparative ultracentrifuge</article-title><source>Clin Chem</source><year>1972</year><volume>18(6)</volume><fpage>499</fpage><lpage>502</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">4337382</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="R16"><label>16</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group><name><surname>Saravanan</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Pari</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Effect of a novel insulinotropic agent, succinic acid monoethyl ester, on lipids and lipoproteins levels in rats with streptozotocin-nicotinamide-induced type 2 diabetes</article-title><source>J Biosci</source><year>2006</year><volume>31(5)</volume><fpage>581</fpage><lpage>587</lpage><comment>DOI: 10.1007/BF02708410</comment><comment>Available from: <ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://dx.doi.org/10.1007/BF02708410">http://dx.doi.org/10.1007/BF02708410</ext-link></comment><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17301496</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="R17"><label>17</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group><name><surname>Reitman</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Frankel</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>A colormetric method for the determination of serum glutamic oxalocetic and glutamic pyruvic transaminases</article-title><source>Am J Clin Path</source><year>1957</year><volume>28(1)</volume><fpage>56</fpage><lpage>63</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">13458125</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="R18"><label>18</label><mixed-citation publication-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="edit